{"overview":"منگ چوان مادرش را پیش چشم‌هایش می‌دید که کشته می‌شود، پس به شدت تمرین کرد تا روزی بتواند انتقام او را بگیرد؛ اما روزهای آرامش با لغو نامزدی، حمله نیروهای خارجی و سقوط پناهگاه در دست دشمن به هم خورد… برای محافظت از مردم شهر نینگ، شمشیر را برداشت و عهد کرد که قوی‌ترین باشد؛ این مسئولیتی سنگین و سفری طولانی است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Meng Chuan witnessed his mother killed before his eyes, so he trained very hard hoping to one day avenge her death. But his peaceful days were broken as his wedding engagement being called off, an invasion by foreign forces, the sanctuary fallen into enemy hands… In order to protect the people of Ning City, he picked up his sword and vowed to be the strongest. This is a heavy responsibility and a long journey…","tagline_en":"","runtime":23,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":121,"y":2023,"poster":"/5CnVpRxOLWIFXMFvyxoiyaJPoU3.jpg"}],"episodes":105,"crew":["张毅立","我吃西红柿"],"crew_en":["张毅立","Wo Chi Xihongshi"],"countries":["CN"],"cast":[{"name":"Sanshi","role":"(voice)","photo":"/ajQVjnlrTOw6M8qSrwjBXlcCFkg.jpg"},{"name":"段艺璇","role":"(voice)","photo":"/t0SFESlym4mWsrhNM3V1qY7ZQXo.jpg","en":"Duan Yixuan"},{"name":"Liangwei Hu","role":"(voice)","photo":"/l5nVITrXiYTocyCTWevHR9Lgvqn.jpg"},{"name":"马正阳","role":"(voice)","photo":"/d7ySPv0g1cq8QrWbdfqG4YvTxM1.jpg","en":"Ma Zhengyang"},{"name":"斑马","role":"(voice)","photo":"/ik7uxOXJ2XRMJKM1KHw2TqUODXB.jpg","en":"Ma Haifeng"},{"name":"夏觅尘","role":"(voice)","photo":"/pluH4RyBlc8sGqwdTDWxtoyqKlk.jpg","en":"Xia Michen"},{"name":"刘芊含","role":"(voice)","photo":"/vlbc1Mo87d1ZIKc3mwXr1QgUahH.jpg","en":"Liu Qianhan"},{"name":"Zhengjian Hu","role":"(voice)","photo":"/y9A09AMmUbZp4TWvI6fgMYH8dZ8.jpg"},{"name":"赵震","role":"(voice)","photo":"","en":"Zhen Zhao"},{"name":"林強","role":"(voice)","photo":"/SX5ckTBqf0GpZlpR9nnFOPTgzX.jpg","en":"Lin Qiang"},{"name":"Dong Zhou","role":"(voice)","photo":"/bldp0UiQAXgXHH9ooB721Ax8Uai.jpg","en":"Zhou Dong"},{"name":"宝木中阳","